From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: d012 setup <setup@localhost>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] The game data can live in a folder any file manager opens

On Android the data folder (saves, textures, mods, cheats) is the app private storage, which no file manager shows. With all files access it is now a folder in the phone shared storage that the profile names (GameProfile::android_shared_data_folder): a fresh install with access uses it at once, and an existing player moves to it with a button that copies everything, writes a marker last (so a stopped move changes nothing) and restarts; the old copy stays until a second button deletes it. The logs stay in the private folder, where they are written.
---

